  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot , bring half the coconut milk to a slow boil , stirring constantly",
    "Add the curry paste and shrimp , stir well , and cook until done , about 5 minutes",
    "Add the remaining coconut milk , water , bamboo shoots , sugar , paprika and fish sauce , and bring to a boil slowly",
    "Add salt",
    "Add bell peppers and basil leaves , and remove from heat",
